</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Rameh</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Parsons</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Cantley</surname><given-names>LC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Association of phosphatidylinositol 3-kinase, via SH2 domains of p85, with focal adhesion kinase in polyoma middle t-transformed fibroblasts</article-title><source>Biochim Biophys Acta</source><year>1996</year><volume>1311</volume><fpage>45</fpage><lpage>52</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8603102</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="other">Bauer, J., J. Varner, C. Schreiner, L. Kornberg, R. Nicholas, and R.L. Juliano.  1993. Functional role of the cytoplasmic domain of the integrin alpha 5 subunit. J. Cell Biol. 122:209&#x02013;221.</citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Birge</surname><given-names>RB</given-names></name><name><surname>Fajardo</surname><given-names>JE</given-names></name><name><surname>Reichman</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Shoelson</surname><given-names>SE</given-names></name><name><surname>Songyang</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name><name><surname>Cantley</surname><given-names>LC</given-names></name><name><surname>Hanafusa</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Identification and characterization of a highaffinity interaction between v-Crk and tyrosine-phosphorylated paxillin in CT10-transformed fibroblasts</article-title><source>Mol Cell Biol</source><year>1993</year><volume>13</volume><fpage>4648</fpage><lpage>4656</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7687742</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bockholt</surname><given-names>SB</given-names></name><name><surname>Burridge</surname><given-names>K</given-names></n